# Game SDK and games

- SDK exposes: getUser(), save(data), load(), optional onPause() for autosave.
- Games must not import platform internals or connect to Postgres/Supabase directly.
- Games are static bundles (index.html + assets); keep build output self-contained.
- New games: manifest.json with id, slug, version, entry, saveSchemaVersion, maxSaveBytes.
- Do not break SDK API without versioning; document breaking changes in package changelog.
